    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18095" root="زمخ" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَامِخٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَامِخٌ</span> [<i>Proud,</i> &amp;c.]; (S, K;) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَامِخٌ بِأَنْفِهِ</span> [<i>elevating his nose, from pride</i>]: (A,
L:) [pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُمَّخٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُنُوفٌ زُمَّخٌ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُمَّخٌ</span> [<i>Noses
elevated, from pride</i>]. (S, A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبَالٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَا أُنُوفٌ زُمَّخٌ</span>, (A, TA,) i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِوَالٌ</span> (tropical:)  [<i>Mountains
having tall,</i> or <i>long, prominences</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَيْلٌ زَامِخٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Full measure.</i> (JK, A, K.)

